    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This conveniently located two-bedroom apartment is situated on the ground floor and comprises two bedrooms, one bathroom, and a bright, open-plan living and kitchen area.\r\nThe property is ideally located close to a wide range of amenities, including local shops, schools and Bon Secours Hospital. Tralee town centre is also within a short stroll, offering easy access to a variety of cafés, restaurants and local services.\r\nAn ideal choice for those seeking a well-located home within easy reach of the town centre and everyday amenities."
      },
